  "id": "grilled-flat-iron-steak-with-blue-cheese-chive-butter",
  "name": "Grilled Flat Iron Steak with Blue Cheese-Chive Butter",
  "subtitle": "Marinated steak finished with savory herb butter",
  "description": "A marinated flat iron steak grilled until tender and topped with blue cheese, chives, and softened butter.",
